    rdfs:comment "Author: Nora Bateson. Published September 1, 2026 by Triarchy Press. Described by its own publisher as 'a cookbook for life' — an exploration of nth-order effects and 'the among-ing of all life' through food, family, illness, migration, and ecology."@en ;
    dct:source <https://www.triarchypress.net/belly.html> ;
    .

